    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-trībŭlo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
			ātum, 1, <i>v. a., to crush, bruise</i>
			(eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capita draconum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Psa. 73, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dorsum ipsorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ecclus. 35, 22 sq.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to afflict much, to
				crush</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacrificium Deo spiritus contribulatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Psa. 50, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rogationem contribulati abicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ecclus. 4, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
